WEBVTT

00:00:05.552 --> 00:00:11.552
Check that the Dashboard is open.
It is your home in the admin.

00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:18.942
Choose Videos in the side menu to
see every video you have added.

00:00:20.468 --> 00:00:26.468
Choose Upload in the side
menu to add a new video.

00:00:26.988 --> 00:00:32.988
Choose Encoding in the side
menu to watch videos get ready.

00:00:34.109 --> 00:00:40.109
Choose Captions in the side menu
to check the words on screen.

00:00:41.432 --> 00:00:47.432
Choose Home curation in the side
menu to arrange the Home page.

00:00:48.822 --> 00:00:54.822
Choose Analytics in the side
menu to read your numbers.

00:00:55.676 --> 00:01:01.676
Choose Help centre in the side
menu when you need a guide.

00:01:02.731 --> 00:01:08.731
Choose Dashboard in the
side menu to come back home.
